  <item>
    <title>No.5 | 消失一个月的 防不胜“房”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b1ef811f8c44b4eaa9020a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b1ef811f8c44b4eaa9020a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Aug 2024 09:40:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>已经感受到好朋友们的极力催更（不是），所以我们这期一拖再拖的播客终于在一个大吉之日顺利开录了。我们席地而坐在空旷的Hoki's house，吃着庆祝芝士蛋糕，喝着绿豆椰子水，聊着这一个月里发生的“人生大事”👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 揭晓“人生大事” 事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> “偷感”很重的办完人生大事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 买房过程的心理情绪变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 来自父母给到的“感动”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 突如其来的“焦虑感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 通过装修来满足自己的小愿望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 本期好歌推荐 - </span><em><span>小霞/海洋Bo 《向云端》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>席地：Hoki's new house🏡</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Axero - Try &nbsp;； Cane - Chariots Of Fire</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltRpP-vFyc5ANOww89TwzihXGV1_.m4a" length="47165380" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:25</itunes:duration>
