  <item>
    <title>No.4 | 我们要怎么和“朋友”相处</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667e92d89c477b6102e63c59</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667e92d89c477b6102e63c59</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次播客是一次灵感突发、一拍即合的紧急录制，从选题到最终上线，我们经历了有趣又疯狂的24小时⭐️</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于【péng you】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“朋友”在每个人心里都有不同的定义，其中一种是基于相互理解、支持、信任和尊重的人际关系，在我们的人生旅途中扮演着不可或缺的角色。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于【这期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不是讲和朋友相处的方法论，而是主理人和台长作为朋友的一个开心分享，例如Hoki👨🏻‍🦰经历了在乡下的“鬼故事”，Hans👨🏻经历了被突然拉黑的悲惨经历等等等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>迫不及待要吃瓜了，快来听听⬇️&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> “朋友管理”是个学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 成为朋友的“标准手册”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 交到好朋友的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> Hoki👨🏻‍🦰和闺蜜的“鬼故事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> Hans👨🏻被拉黑的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> Double H 的初见印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> 关于朋友关系破裂的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 本期好歌推荐 -</span><em><span> 魏如萱 艾怡良《达尔文》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>席地：Hoki's Home</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Axero - Try &nbsp;； Cane - Chariots Of Fire</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljdHarJvLJCT2dpSdnK1Z_8Psjzy.m4a" length="64126958" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdCHOT2Wlyk1d6be5_-6Y_1l2-o.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.3 | 来自《悉达多》的启示</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667a7ffc1d87fbc3610228ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667a7ffc1d87fbc3610228ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jun 2024 08:29:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们“席地而坐”在汤泉生活馆，想跟大家分享近期读物—赫尔曼·黑塞的《悉达多》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这本书讲述了一位婆罗门之子-悉达多起起落落的一生，从中给到我们很多启发和触动。它让Hoki👨🏻‍🦰感受到要辩证的看待当下，学会多角度的看待事物，让Hans👨🏻感受到人生中要学会放下和放过自己，也要关注和觉察自我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们开始这次心灵的修行：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 《悉达多》的故事梗概</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 从书中获得的启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> “悉达多”和他的好友“果文达”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 探讨“从一同出发到分道扬镳”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 书中最喜欢的“人物”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 书中最难忘的“故事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 对作者/作品的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 本期好歌推荐 - </span><em><span>王菲 归途有风</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>席地：</span><em><span>北京 V汤泉生活馆</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span><em><span>Axero - Try &nbsp;； Cane - Chariots Of Fire</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/licdFIoxCR2XRMvGB4G_IRe73n_4.m4a" length="46954649" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgkVfqQ35sGwUeYTn6lS6-H6gx69.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.2 | 关于“三十而立”的那点事儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664de001c59d1e5757f6f7df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664de001c59d1e5757f6f7df</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>自古以来，三十岁常会被认作人生道路上的一个“分水岭”，与之相关的话题也少不了【三十而立】、【焦虑】、【转折点】、【婚姻家庭】等等这些名词。作为两位“过来人”，我们反观自己的三十岁，分享当时的情绪感受和跨过这座山岭后的变化。也许，会给你一些熟悉、一些共鸣、一些安慰 🥰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 关于三十岁的焦虑&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> “过来人”的焦虑情绪前后变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> “三十而立”的解释和理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> 缓解焦虑情绪的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 三十岁的“仪式感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> 本期的“惊喜连连”👨🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a> 本期好歌推荐 -</span><em><span>苏运莹/Kui </span></em><em><span>Kui </span></em><em><span>&nbsp;人生是旷野</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>最后，祝我们的Hans台长，生日快乐🎂</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Axero - Try</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Cane - Chariots Of Fire&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqqyZLyJLaOZS7bOgNq-GeNIvBDo.m4a" length="37882063" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqU0VjZm_jXM-2TJLhg0iEjYIBrl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.1 | “北京男团”的首尔小游记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6641db0e7096082641ce8d7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6641db0e7096082641ce8d7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 May 2024 09:19:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>四月中旬，我们临时组建了【上韩山】的四人”北京男团“。带着各自的心情和目的，开启了韩国首尔的踏春之旅。时间虽短暂，开心永无限，即便不睡觉，也无法感受完所有的快乐。</span></p><p><span>“北京男团”的团魂就是默契和开心，我们享受凌晨吹着夜风在便利店吃小食的轻松时刻；也享受半夜在酒吧街上穿梭，在舞池里尽情乱舞；男团有人负责安排，有人只管享受（没错就是我俩）；即便大雨挡道、语言不通，也阻拦不了我们寻找美食的动力。</span></p><p><span>我们开心旅程里遇见的所有欣喜，更开心我们在一起的每刻时光💖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> &nbsp;开启旅行的前奏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> &nbsp;酒店分享【首尔君悦酒店】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>【新沙洞】里的打卡圣地 -Adererror、Tamburins</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 【圣水洞】里的好店推荐 -Coor、Umbro、Brompton</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> &nbsp;首尔的酒吧文化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> &nbsp;特别美食体验 -生牛肉活章鱼刺身、土豆脊骨汤、BHC炸鸡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 【九价疫苗】的小播报</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> &nbsp;本期好歌推荐 -</span><em><span>野菊花 걱정말아요 그대 (你不要担心)</span></em></p><p><em><span>-</span></em></p><p><em><span>BGM:</span></em></p><ul><li><p><em><span>Axero - Try</span></em></p></li><li><p><em><span>Cane - Chariots Of Fire</span></em></p></li></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loOMBhpcL3eRkmHTL94hbQlXf1M-.m4a" length="24587973" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkkX92Mp2f4rqR8aFa80hV28BXFk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
